     1	"""V2 feature snapshot builder — standalone CLI worker.
     2	
     3	Lifts ``v2/backend/app/services/feature_snapshots/service.py`` out of the
     4	``paper_online_runtime`` loop so feature snapshots can be produced
     5	independently. Reads an input payload (from a JSON file, or from the
     6	``paper_online`` runtime's existing public payload as a fallback), runs
     7	``FeatureSnapshotService.build_snapshot``, and writes:
     8	
     9	  - ``v2/frontend/public/operator_runtime/v2_feature_snapshot_builder/latest/v2_feature_snapshot_builder_status.json``
    10	  - ``claude_worklog/final_readiness/emergency_v2_runtime_migration/latest/workers/v2_feature_snapshot_builder_status.json``
    11	
    12	Hard rules (all enforced by tests):
    13	  - Live gate is always reported as ``blocked_human_only``; this worker
    14	    cannot unblock it and has no exchange-action codepath.
    15	  - No legacy Redis writes. No exchange order/leverage/margin calls.
    16	  - When required feature categories are missing, the worker emits a
    17	    fail-closed status (``trainer_readiness == "BLOCKED_MISSING_REQUIRED"``)
    18	    and returns exit code 2 on a single-shot run.
