     1	"""V2 dynamic symbol-universe runtime resolver.
     2	
     3	Single source of truth that every V2 ingestor / feature / TA / liquidation
     4	worker uses to pick its default symbol set. Replaces hard-coded
     5	``BTCUSDT/ETHUSDT/SOLUSDT`` or ``BTCUSDT`` defaults that Codex 5.5
     6	flagged as a 3-symbol/BTC-only drift in
